Suffering from Alzheimer's disease

00:09:57.230 --> 00:10:00.266
Get seven hours of sleep every day

00:10:00.266 --> 00:10:01.868
No more forcing yourself to not sleep

00:10:01.868 --> 00:10:03.102
Musk also said

00:10:03.102 --> 00:10:04.537
Less than six hours of sleep

00:10:04.537 --> 00:10:06.940
The brain hurts badly

00:10:06.940 --> 00:10:08.741
Sleep is not a waste of time

00:10:08.741 --> 00:10:10.410
It's the most important moment

00:10:10.410 --> 00:10:14.147
for the brain to clean itself up.

00:10:14.147 --> 00:10:16.816
When a person is in deep sleep

00:10:16.816 --> 00:10:18.585
The brain clears a substance called

00:10:18.585 --> 00:10:20.987
Waste products of beta-amyloid

00:10:20.987 --> 00:10:22.856
Excessive accumulation of this protein

00:10:22.856 --> 00:10:24.991
Will damage nerve cells

00:10:24.991 --> 00:10:26.092
Affects memory

00:10:26.092 --> 00:10:28.394
It may even lead to dementia

00:10:28.394 --> 00:10:31.564
A study by the National Institutes of Health found

00:10:31.564 --> 00:10:33.166
Healthy adults

00:10:33.166 --> 00:10:35.268
After staying up for 30 hours

00:10:35.268 --> 00:10:37.804
This protein in the brain

00:10:37.804 --> 00:10:39.339
Started to accumulate

00:10:39.339 --> 00:10:40.406
Another study

00:10:40.406 --> 00:10:41.975
of 8,000 middle-aged

00:10:41.975 --> 00:10:44.277
and elderly people found that

00:10:44.277 --> 00:10:46.813
People who sleep less than six hours a night

00:10:46.813 --> 00:10:47.881
Dementia risk

00:10:47.881 --> 00:10:50.350
than those who sleep 7.8 hours

00:10:50.350 --> 00:10:52.652
30% higher

00:10:52.652 --> 00:10:54.320
Sleep until you are full and sleep well

00:10:54.320 --> 00:10:56.389
people can be healthy and live long

00:10:56.389 --> 00:10:57.390
Not only that

00:10:57.390 --> 00:10:58.391
American Heart Association

00:10:58.391 --> 00:10:59.926
Sleep is also listed

00:10:59.926 --> 00:11:01.861
as one of the eight elements

00:11:01.861 --> 00:11:03.663
to maintain cardiovascular health

00:11:03.663 --> 00:11:06.432
Sufficient and good sleep can help

00:11:06.432 --> 00:11:08.935
Repair blood vessels and strengthen immunity

00:11:08.935 --> 00:11:11.004
Reduce chronic inflammation

00:11:11.004 --> 00:11:13.873
Effectively prevent cardiovascular disease

00:11:13.873 --> 00:11:15.675
Poor sleep is not just

00:11:15.675 --> 00:11:17.343
Makes you feel depressed

00:11:17.343 --> 00:11:18.311
More likely

00:11:18.311 --> 00:11:21.915
Harmful to heart and brain health

00:11:21.915 --> 00:11:24.651
Sleeping is the simplest

00:11:24.651 --> 00:11:26.319
and most effective way

00:11:26.319 --> 00:11:29.822
to completely eliminate fatigue.

00:11:29.822 --> 00:11:31.658
Two major causes of insomnia

00:11:31.658 --> 00:11:34.093
Make melatonin out of stock

00:11:34.093 --> 00:11:36.963
Two common culprits of poor sleep

00:11:36.963 --> 00:11:38.331
Always using your phone

00:11:38.331 --> 00:11:39.732
head keeps thinking

00:11:39.732 --> 00:11:41.701
Insufficient melatonin secretion

00:11:41.701 --> 00:11:43.670
The more you lie down, the more awake you become

00:11:43.670 --> 00:11:44.537
What do you think

00:11:44.537 --> 00:11:45.471
about when you can't sleep?

00:11:45.471 --> 00:11:46.673
want to sleep

00:11:46.673 --> 00:11:47.941
The problem is that the brain

00:11:47.941 --> 00:11:49.943
is like a late-night live broadcast

00:11:49.943 --> 00:11:52.178
The sympathetic nervous system basically never gets off work

00:11:52.178 --> 00:11:53.913
Don't lie hard on the bed

00:11:53.913 --> 00:11:55.481
Tossing and turning only makes

00:11:55.481 --> 00:11:56.883
the brain more tense

00:11:56.883 --> 00:11:58.251
Stimulate sympathetic nerves

00:11:58.251 --> 00:12:00.253
Inhibits the secretion of melatonin

00:12:00.253 --> 00:12:01.387
Also caused

00:12:01.387 --> 00:12:03.957
Difficulty falling asleep and light sleep

00:12:03.957 --> 00:12:05.625
Finally there is one

00:12:05.625 --> 00:12:08.728
The troublesome sleep killer

00:12:08.728 --> 00:12:10.263
I know I know

00:12:10.263 --> 00:12:11.297
Mobile phone

00:12:11.297 --> 00:12:12.732
Blue light from mobile phones

00:12:12.732 --> 00:12:15.368
It tricks the brain into thinking it's daytime

00:12:15.368 --> 00:12:17.637
Melatonin is not secreted

00:12:17.637 --> 00:12:20.206
The brain keeps turning on

00:12:20.206 --> 00:12:22.208
The more you use it, the more awake you become.

00:12:22.208 --> 00:12:23.743
Staying up late to browse the phone

00:12:23.743 --> 00:12:24.577
Remind you

00:12:24.577 --> 00:12:25.845
Don't look at your phone

00:12:25.845 --> 00:12:28.147
for too long.

00:12:28.147 --> 00:12:29.048
Experts have said

00:12:29.048 --> 00:12:31.184
That way the phone will run out of battery.

00:12:31.184 --> 00:12:32.452
Wake up the next day

00:12:32.452 --> 00:12:36.255
You will get two dark circles haha

00:12:36.256 --> 00:12:37.724
Is it harmful

00:12:37.724 --> 00:12:39.258
if I look at it like this often?

00:12:39.258 --> 00:12:41.828
Ha, staying up late is nothing big.

00:12:41.828 --> 00:12:43.796
Just be careful in your next life.

